            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/596090/extras/a0beea6c0d9f3b6bfbeb9b33bf7c656f.avif?t=1692171600\" width=600 height=120 /></span><br><br>Gray Destiny is an <strong>indie precision platformer</strong> that offers an <strong>atmospheric</strong> and <strong>captivating experience</strong>. Take control of the young boy as he navigates through a series of meticulously crafted levels, each more challenging than the last. The game's visuals blend hauntingly beautiful landscapes with dark, foreboding environments, immersing players in a gripping tale of self-discovery.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/596090/extras/855b3b22e3c09fc5bd0b58d4c3bfbe06.avif?t=1692171600\" width=600 height=120 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Intense Precision Platforming:</strong> Master the art of precision jumping, wall-climbing, and timing to overcome an array of traps, obstacles, and terrifying ghosts.<br></li><li> <strong>Gradually Increasing Difficulty:</strong> Progress through 100 hand-designed levels, each growing progressively more difficult and rewarding for players who dare to conquer them.<br></li><li> <strong>Dynamic Gameplay Mechanics:</strong> Discover and utilize unique abilities that aid the boy on his journey, adding depth and variety to the platforming challenges.<br></li><li> <strong>Inspiring Art Style:</strong> Experience a visually striking world, blending darkness and light to create a captivating aesthetic.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/596090/extras/019ac3badc0c9e7e3c9bf91f318c23ac.avif?t=1692171600\" width=600 height=120 /></span><br><br>Don't forget to leave a review. Your feedback is helpful and keeps us motivated and eager to continue adding new features and content to the game. All future content will be included for free (we don't like DLCs either). :)<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/596090/extras/cd655238da18b0d3be6246d73dfdc2ef.avif?t=1692171600\" width=600 height=120 /></span><br><br>In the mysterious world of Gray Destiny, you embark on a journey alongside a young boy who wakes up in a dimly lit cave with no memory of his past. As he looks around, the darkness seems to swallow him whole, leaving him only one thought – to escape and uncover the truth about his forgotten identity. <br><br><br>The boy's journey tests courage, agility, and wit. As he ventures deeper into the cave, he encounters ominous ghosts that lurk in the shadows, remnants of his fading memories. He must confront his inner fears and piece together fragments of his past to shed light on the mystery shrouding his existence.<br><br>Will the boy find his way out of the cave and into the light? Or will he forever remain lost in the shadows of his forgotten memories? Only those with unwavering determination and keen precision will uncover the truth in this unforgettable indie platformer.",
