 to continue adding new features and content to the game. All future content will be included for free (we don't like DLCs either). :)<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/596090/extras/cd655238da18b0d3be6246d73dfdc2ef.avif?t=1692171600\" width=600 height=120 /></span><br><br>In the mysterious world of Gray Destiny, you embark on a journey alongside a young boy who wakes up in a dimly lit cave with no memory of his past. As he looks around, the darkness seems to swallow him whole, leaving him only one thought – to escape and uncover the truth about his forgotten identity. <br><br><br>The boy's journey tests courage, agility, and wit. As he ventures deeper into the cave, he encounters ominous ghosts that lurk in the shadows, remnants of his fading memories. He must confront his inner fears and piece together fragments of his past to shed light on the mystery shrouding his existence.<br><br>Will the boy find his way out of the cave and into the light? Or will he forever remain lost in the shadows of his forgotten memories? Only those with unwavering determination and keen precision will uncover the truth in this unforgettable indie platformer.",
